!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = genotype: expressing Cas9 and non-targeting (Scramble) sgRNA
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: Untreated control
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = THP-1 cells were treated with LPS (1µg/mL) over a time-course and HT-29 cells were treated with CDK9i (AZ5576, 170nM, 2 hours), DBK-1154 (10µM, 2 hours 15 minutes) or a combination of both
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Cells were cultured in RPMI-1640 supplemented with 10-20 percent heat-inactivated fetal bovine serum, 100U/mL penicillin, 100µg/mL streptomycin and 2mM GlutaMAX at 37 degrees celciuus and 5 percent carbon dioxide
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Cells were lysed in TriZol reagent and total DNAse-treated RNA isolated using the Zymogen RNA mini-prep kit. For HT-29 cells, total RNA (5 percent) from Drosophila S2 cells was spiked into each human RNA sample.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA libraries were prepared using the Lexogen QuantSeq 3'-mRNA Seq Library Prep kit (015)
!Sample_description = SCR-UT-1_S32
!Sample_description = LPS_WT_vs_KO_normalizedcounts.csv
!Sample_description = counts_LPS.txt
!Sample_data_processing = Sequenced reads were demultiplexed using bcl2fastq (v2.17.1.14)
!Sample_data_processing = Basic QC performed on fastq files using FASTQC (v0.11.6)
!Sample_data_processing = Sequencing reads were trimmed using cutadapt (v2.1) and aligned to the Hg19 or a combined Hg19/dm3 reference genome using HISAT 2 (v2.1.0)
!Sample_data_processing = Read counting across genomic regions was performed using the Subread (v2.0.0) featureCounts function and differential gene expression analysis was performed in Rstudio (v3.6.1) using Voom-Limma (v3.42.2)
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: Hg19 and dm3
