!Sample_data_processing = Basic QC performed on fastq files using FASTQC (v0.11.6)
!Sample_data_processing = Sequencing reads were trimmed using cutadapt (v2.1) and aligned to the Hg19 or a combined Hg19/dm3 reference genome using HISAT 2 (v2.1.0)
